^SAMPLE = GSM4257801
!Sample_title = DPM3_mutant_EBs_10days
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM4257801
!Sample_status = Public on Jul 30 2020
!Sample_submission_date = Jan 09 2020
!Sample_last_update_date = Jul 30 2020
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = mutant embryoid bodies
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: mutant embryoid bodies
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = differentiation stage: Spontaneous differentiation for 10 days
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = strain: H9 hESCs
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = hESCs grown on feeder layer MEFs to 50-60% confluency were washed with PBS and gently dissociated using 0.25% Trypsin Solution A (Biological Industries) for 5 min at 37 0C. Dissociated colonies were harvested and transferred on non-adherent 10 cm dishes as suspension in EB medium, composed of knockout Dulbecco’s modified Eagle’s medium (DMEM) supplemented with 15% knockout serum replacement (KSR, Thermo Fisher Scientific), 2 mM L-glutamine, 0.1 mM nonessential amino acids, 50 units ml-1 penicillin, 50 µg ml-1 streptomycin and 0.1 mM β-mercaptoethanol. The cell aggregates in suspension were gently fed with EB medium every other day until 10th day.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = hESCs were cultured at 37 0C and 5% CO2 in feeder-free conditions on Matrigel-coated plates (Corning) in mTeSR1 (STEMCELL Technologies).
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = At the end of the differentiation assays, cells were harvested and total RNA was extracted with a RNeasy Mini Kit (QIAGEN).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = mRNA fraction of total RNA was enriched by pulldown of poly(A)-RNA. RNA sequencing libraries were generated using TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit (Illumina) according to the manufacturer’s protocol and sequenced using Illumina NextSeq 500 with 75 bp single-end reads.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were mapped to the reference genome and annotated using STAR 2.4.0.1 software.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38 reference genome
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: comma separated values (csv) file contains transcript counts for each sample.
